# Licenses

The **ORC (Ozone Request for Comments)** repository is dual-licensed to accommodate both public specification documents and software implementations:

## Specifications and Documentation

All specification documents, standards, processes, and documentation in this repository are released into the public domain under the **Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication**.

To the extent possible under law, the authors and contributors of the ORC repository have waived all copyright and related or neighboring rights to the specifications, processes, templates, and markdown documentation.

Full text: [https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/)

---

